crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/05c096bfccc875109cf330694552f94a.poster.avif?t=1785162184\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/05c096bfccc875109cf330694552f94a.webm?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the goals of one tree are met, a hot air balloon carries part of your community to the next. With every journey, you decide who to take with you, shaping a generational narrative where bonds, sacrifices, and memories carry forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a game of strategy and care, where gentle creativity meets deep social dynamics, and every village tells its own story among the treetops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/65abccb5197635287eda76fcae38207a.poster.avif?t=1785162184\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/extras/65abccb5197635287eda76fcae38207a.webm?t=1785162184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Treetopians is a cozy colony simulator where players build vertical villages in the treetops and care for a growing community of villagers with unique needs and personalities.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/e21dfd3e9e0b2045669dd357fd1c7dedd3b65b57/header.jpg?t=1785162184", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967310/59f16942eebd387ec1d50725